解释之外，没有本研究申办者的书面授权许可，任何个人不得分发、复制、发表或披露本文件的任何内容。","quote_sha256":"3e36ef829343646179e1d5749da1ab0a5b471c1d62768ea76ad36b9424e29c63","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b","span_id":"es5"},{"locator":"section:文档开头|block:4|chunk:1","quote":"本方案中所包含的所有信息归申办方所有，因此，仅提供给研究者、合作研究者、伦理委员会和监督管理部门等相关机构进行审阅。在未得到申办方书面批准的情况下，除了在与可能参加本研究的受试者签署知情同意书时，向其做必要的解释外，严禁将任何信息告知与本研究无关的第三方。","quote_sha256":"dfc9fceb41db9d941df0e3715483adaa069da4f1953600a6a37a56d7f81373dd","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","span_id":"es6"},{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_8deea3cca149a555:full-draft:06253a582c0344a7702cfff4","quote":"SECTION_ID=mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_42e0b11c5653cec2\n章节编号=11.4\n章节标题=保密与隐私\n章节类型=section\n当前正文=（当前为空，需生成实质正文）","quote_sha256":"aec402faaafc483163436946a823328329b89578615a41d779cf71a8e7046e8d","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:06253a582c0344a7702cfff4","span_id":"es10"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es5","es6","es10"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认受试者个人健康信息的加密、访问控制、去标识化及存储地点等具体技术措施","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_11_4_a","missing_source_classes":["数据管理SOP","信息安全规范"],"target":"数据保护具体技术措施"},{"action":"确认是否涉及数据跨境传输及相应审批安排，明确数据保留期限","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_11_4_b","missing_source_classes":["数据跨境传输审批文件","数据保留政策"],"target":"跨境传输与数据保留"}],"heading":"保密与隐私","missing_source_classes":["受试者数据保护具体技术措施","数据存储地点及跨境传输规则","数据保留期限规定"],"proposal_text":"本方案中所包含的所有信息归申办方所有，仅提供给研究者、合作研究者、伦理委员会和监督管理部门等相关机构进行审阅。在未得到申办方书面批准的情况下，除了在与可能参加本研究的受试者签署知情同意书时向其做必要的解释外，严禁将任何信息告知与本研究无关的第三方。必须告知接收本文件信息的人员其接收的信息是保密的，不得进一步对外披露。受试者的个人健康信息保护遵循中国现行法律法规及伦理委员会审查要求；具体数据管理、存储、访问权限及跨境传输安排由申办方数据管理部门与研究中心在研究启动前协商确定，并在研究主文件中记录。","rationale":"保密条款措辞参照公司语料中两份不同适应症II期方案的保密声明（跨适应症，仅作监管共性结构参照）；受试者隐私保护的具体技术措施、数据存储地点及跨境传输规则在当前允许来源中未给出，故以范围性表述覆盖并标注待确认。需医学经理确认：是否需在本章明确引用《个人信息保护法》《人类遗传资源管理条例》等具体法规；数据跨境传输是否涉及及相应审批安排；各中心数据管理SOP是否需在此处引用。","review_advisories":[],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_42e0b11c5653cec2","section_number":"11.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:06253a582c0344a7702cfff4","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:665025df83658b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:342cfc57d67b67","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:9939b9aa574982","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:1e80f33ff07300","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:99911e01a39256"]}],"source_bindings":[{"content_sha256":"79ee7cc7ea6538ce708ef3aeb13d9b32977a7d4ac761b264287f853d0d388871","locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_415ce4db48b2_8deea3cca149a555:full-draft:06253a582c0344a7702cfff4","role":"current_working_draft_packet","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:06253a582c0344a7702cfff4","source_type":"protocol_full_draft_selection","source_version":"full-draft:74bc4d137995a3fbc08798d185a3087639dacc8b6f5d24c66b6f3176731163ab:06253a582c0344a7702cfff4","text_sha256":"79ee7cc7ea6538ce708ef3aeb13d9b32977a7d4ac761b264287f853d0d388871"},{"content_sha256":"777cdc93ca4a7fe17e838438578b2466fb5f96c6bb5a3654ef59b0b7d1fbded2","locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:revision:7","role":"confirmed_project_facts","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","source_type":"current_project_study_definition","source_version":"mwdefinition_fb549ea860136ec4fedf:r7:47d0cec7ceedc189","text_sha256":"777cdc93ca4a7fe17e838438578b2466fb5f96c6bb5a3654ef59b0b7d1fbded2"},{"content_sha256":"8057617d1964e3423a8b531b36e60104d5287e4d9023114f9c3ff9663a282c5f","locator":"section:研究方案|block:3|chunk:1","role":"company_sop_or_protocol_reference","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_2026